        CreateListIterator(argumentsList), [[Done]]: false}.
    24. If hasDuplicates is true, then
        [...]
    25. Else,
        a. Perform ? IteratorBindingInitialization for formals with
           iteratorRecord and env as arguments.
    [...]

---*/


