    9.2.1.3 OrdinaryCallEvaluateBody ( F, argumentsList )

    1. Let status be FunctionDeclarationInstantiation(F, argumentsList).
    [...]

    9.2.12 FunctionDeclarationInstantiation(func, argumentsList)

