    9.2.1 [[Call]] ( thisArgument, argumentsList)

    [...]
    7. Let result be OrdinaryCallEvaluateBody(F, argumentsList).
    [...]

    9.2.1.3 OrdinaryCallEvaluateBody ( F, argumentsList )

