    GetIterator ( obj [ , hint ] )

    ...
    3. If hint is async,
      a. Set method to ? GetMethod(obj, @@asyncIterator).
    ...

    GetMethod ( V, P )

    ...
    2. Let func be ? GetV(V, P).
